Round gen_r7 is complete. Both deliverable files are written (`impl` resolves via symlink to `impl_7/` — edits landed correctly), wisdom is stripped on all three hosts, and the library API stayed frozen.

**Ended on: four-stage in-place knob racing behind per-host wisdom — salt-bumped chain7/tile7/fm7 races over planner's new fused-Good-Thomas/DFT7 trees, plus a NEW "p47" stage racing the @s4 stage-block width by in-place flip with lazy stage growth; best a80n0 numbers: 1.34 µs/xform batched (L=10 B=64; L=12 B=64 2.34 µs) and 3.82 µs at B=1 (L=12), rel L2 = 2.8–4.8e-16 everywhere (tol 1e-12), all map-chain/two-step gates PASS, bit-identical repeatability.**

Details worth knowing:

